%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H11_X2_1_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: I glare at the boys angrily and make my way over to them.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What's your damn problem?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Damn, chill out.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1db2ac0b4f5a40cb979d070820ee426c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Yeah\u2026 we're just joking around."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dd01d3b0a4834cadae86b4e8dc786e45, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He's the one dressed up as a horse at the gym, he's clearly asking for
      attention.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1db2ac0b4f5a40cb979d070820ee426c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: My blood is boiling. But I can't cause a scene right now. I just want to
      stand up for Mr. Horse.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Just mind your own business, okay? We're just working out. Like everyone
      else here.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They chuckle.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Well, let's agree to disagree on that one.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 64d8596f837844dc9a6de66f43ba811f, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: This isn't helping. There's no point in arguing with these weirdos. Even
      if I'd love to smash their faces in right now. I could probably use Mr. Horse's
      help with that though.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So, you're not gonna tell us why you're hanging out at the gym with horsie?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1db2ac0b4f5a40cb979d070820ee426c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Are you training for your next hurdle race or something?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dd01d3b0a4834cadae86b4e8dc786e45, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Oh my god, don't tell me you're riding him\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 64d8596f837844dc9a6de66f43ba811f, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Once again, they erupt in laughter.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I think it's best if I just distance myself now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Without another word I go looking for Mr. Horse. I find him in the adjacent
      room, leaning against a railing.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Hey, Mr. Horse, I'm sorry about them. They don't have anything better to
      do.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No, it is all good. I needed to take a rest in any case.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 1
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In all honesty, I have simply not quite felt like myself today. I am unsure
      as of why that is, exactly. It may be a good idea to end our session for today.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yeah, I agree.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0edfb2c7f1f8272498381ab59722dc9a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f61dff0949eb40f99b1455e6bd5bffe7, type: 2}
